portrait-local
==============

이 저장소의 원저작물(코드·UI·문서·도구 설계 — app.py, ui.html, selftest.py, setup.sh, pack.sh, gpu_pick.py, README.md)은
DongJu Kim(gggg8657)이 작성했다(PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0). 제3자 구성요소는 각자의 라이선스를 따르며 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md 에 적었다.
제3자 구성요소의 권리는 이 저장소의 라이선스로 바뀌지 않는다.

연구·내부 시험용 프로토타입이다(배포·상업 서비스용 아님).

Wraps (does not modify) LivePortrait — https://github.com/KwaiVGI/LivePortrait (MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 Kuaishou Visual
Generation and Interaction Center; see LICENSE-LivePortrait), vendored at setup time into vendor/ (commit 9b294b3).
Motion templates in templates/ are converted copies of LivePortrait's assets/examples/driving/*.pkl (motion data only, no video).

Model weights (downloaded at setup into weights/, not in this git repository):
  - LivePortrait weights (HF KwaiVGI/LivePortrait, model card: MIT).
  - InsightFace buffalo_l detection/landmark models: InsightFace states its pre-trained models are
    for NON-COMMERCIAL RESEARCH purposes only. Internal/non-commercial use only unless cleared.
    https://github.com/gggg8657/portrait-local/issues/1
  - pack.sh offline bundles DO contain weights/ (including InsightFace) — do not distribute them outside.

